{%- comment -%}
  Continuous-scroll review marquee (per user request — many reviews that scroll).
  Reviews are hardcoded here because the theme editor strips block settings on sync.
  The track is rendered twice (capture) for a seamless loop. Card styling = mockup .tq.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture cards -%}
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">Been using my Kordovan bifold for two years now and it just keeps getting better. The leather has developed a patina you simply cannot fake. The best wallet I've ever owned.</p><div class="kv-name">— Ahmed Raza</div><div class="kv-meta">Lahore · Full-Grain Bifold Wallet</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">Ordered the messenger bag and was blown away by the quality. The stitching is immaculate and the leather smell alone is worth it. Fast delivery to Islamabad, too.</p><div class="kv-name">— Sara Malik</div><div class="kv-meta">Islamabad · Leather Messenger Bag</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">Finally, a Pakistani brand doing leather the right way — no synthetic shortcuts. The belt I bought has held up perfectly, and somehow looks better now than the day it arrived.</p><div class="kv-name">— Usman Khan</div><div class="kv-meta">Karachi · Handcrafted Leather Belt</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">The jacket exceeded every expectation. Heavy, supple cowhide that's already moulding to me. Got endless compliments at a wedding in Multan. Worth every rupee.</p><div class="kv-name">— Hamza Sheikh</div><div class="kv-meta">Multan · Vintage Biker Jacket</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">Bought the KODO smart wallet for my husband and he hasn't put it down since. Slim, holds everything, and the RFID gives real peace of mind. Brilliant gift.</p><div class="kv-name">— Ayesha Tariq</div><div class="kv-meta">Rawalpindi · KODO Smart Wallet</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">My boots arrived earlier than promised and the craftsmanship is on another level. Broke them in within a week and they're now my everyday pair. Superb.</p><div class="kv-name">— Bilal Ahmed</div><div class="kv-meta">Faisalabad · The Stallion Boot</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">I've gifted three wallets from Kordovan now — to my father, brother, and best friend. Every single one was a hit. Packaging feels premium and personal.</p><div class="kv-name">— Fatima Noor</div><div class="kv-meta">Karachi · Mocha Mate Wallet</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">The tote is exactly what I'd been searching for — roomy, structured, and the leather is genuinely beautiful. Customer service answered every question on WhatsApp.</p><div class="kv-name">— Zainab Qureshi</div><div class="kv-meta">Lahore · The Diva Tote</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">Reversible belt is genius — two looks in one and the buckle feels solid, not cheap. This is the quality I expected to pay double for abroad.</p><div class="kv-name">— Omar Farooq</div><div class="kv-meta">Peshawar · Imperial Reversible Belt</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
  <div class="kv-tcard"><div class="kv-mark">&ldquo;</div><div class="kv-stars">★★★★★</div><p class="kv-quote">Second order from Kordovan and the consistency is what wins me over. Same flawless stitching, same rich smell, same care in the box. A brand you can trust.</p><div class="kv-name">— Hira Aslam</div><div class="kv-meta">Sialkot · Cardholder &amp; Keyring Set</div><div class="kv-verif"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Verified Purchase</div></div>
{%- endcapture -%}

<section class="kv-home kv-section kv-testi">
  <div class="kv-wrap">
    <div class="kv-shead">
      <span class="kv-eyebrow">{{ section.settings.eyebrow | default: 'Reviews' }}</span>
      <h2>{{ section.settings.title | default: 'Loved, carried, and passed on' }}</h2>
      <div class="kv-agg"><span class="s">★★★★★</span> {{ section.settings.aggregate | default: '4.9 / 5 · from 25,000+ happy customers' }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="kv-treel">
    <div class="kv-ttrack">{{ cards }}{{ cards }}</div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Testimonials",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Reviews" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Heading", "default": "Loved, carried, and passed on" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "aggregate", "label": "Aggregate line", "default": "4.9 / 5 · from 25,000+ happy customers" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
